meanings
  accountant
    defined-by concept
    role occupation-title
    precondition "a title names a person responsible for keeping or examining financial accounts"
    effect "identify the accounting occupation"
    unit "not applicable"
    example "the accountant reconciled the invoices with the ledger"
    lexeme en accountant
    lexeme ru бухгалтер
    lexeme hi लेखाकार
    lexeme zh 会计师
    lexeme es contable
  business-to-business
    defined-by concept
    role business-market-qualifier
    precondition "the seller and the customer are both businesses"
    effect "qualify a commercial role or activity as serving business customers"
    unit "not applicable"
    example "a B2B sales manager sells to companies"
    lexeme en B2B "business-to-business"
    lexeme ru "бизнес для бизнеса"
    lexeme hi "व्यवसाय से व्यवसाय"
    lexeme zh 企业对企业
    lexeme es "de empresa a empresa"
